{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0e2864cda4ec2cd0bb8e770923f12e151f689a2d782fae2d34b6d12006ec3905","ja":"そして、最後の問題へ","zh":"然后，迎来最后的问题","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ed075523d1c3c81173f2caf310e3a4299f816defe7bcf52e71ad9317029a1b45","ja":"うっう～！　次、クリアしたら優勝……ってあれ？\n私たち以外にも集まってるみたいですよ。","zh":"呜～！下一关通关就获胜了……咦，奇怪？\n看来除了我们以外，其他人也都聚集过来了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f0f681b54da8a4669f30ab5e89ad0c316240aeda9081cb63d29b7e782ab2afe5","ja":"「最終スポットには3グループが到着！　ではここで、\n優勝者を決める早押しクイズに挑んでもらいます！」","zh":"“已有3个小组到达了最终关卡！那么接下来，\n请大家挑战决定冠军归属的抢答问答！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5fca8063c8ea0e76ae7aa8165b9e4e6e917f993a73462449aa6a7f19a41a9fee","ja":"（早押し……私に答えられる問題、あるかしら……\nもしかしたら、このまま何もできずに……）","zh":"（抢答……会有我能回答上来的问题吗……\n说不定，我就会这样什么都做不了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7281f6e4fc747b16cdd7b94d296947479ac61525071f3768a03ca916020efddf","ja":"「では行きます！　第1問！」","zh":"“那么请听题！第1题！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"91fa934db6ad64b20786ff752326145e545cb92beec953b1dd0e72e589b2f4f4","ja":"……ふぅ。ここまでみんな同点だねぇ。\n次で最後の問題だから、頑張らねば……！","zh":"……呼。到目前为止大家都是平分呢。\n下一题就是最后一题了，必须得加把劲才行……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"858647e1ae4fbf269dfb6aee8806308bb72499dfd0515ac10dbc2975187b0920","ja":"（うう……せ、せめて、1問だけでも……）","zh":"（呜呜……至、至少答对1题也好……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a663a08a3306275241e22e60907bc622a1e16faf38324d89245a54b6d9d83a4a","ja":"「では最終問題は趣向を変えて……イントロクイズ！\n年末おなじみの、この曲名をお答えください！」","zh":"「那么最后一题换个形式……听前奏猜歌名！\n请回答出这首年末大家耳熟能详的歌曲名！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a72c1b60948cfac64e6c55e12a31b43a1ef319cf05d20a9847a8a63d6ab19dec","ja":"（！　音楽なら私にも……！\nで、でも知らない曲が来たら……）","zh":"（！如果是音乐的话我也……！\n但、但要是碰上不知道的曲子该怎么办……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d95928fd674afa5088c4a0fcb5cb6e9d0767ac7aa79ea1c15b87de33643e743f","ja":"（いえ、最後まで諦めちゃダメよ。私も……\n高槻さんと木下さんの力にならないと……！）","zh":"（不，不到最后绝不能放弃。我也得……\n成为高槻同学和木下同学的依靠才行……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9395d636fba519a8c9509a8a798d02064212316b1f97f9265cb9c3b1fc34d477","ja":"あう～……このジャジャジャジャーンって感じ、\n聞いたことある気はしますけど……。","zh":"呜～……总觉得这种“哒哒哒哒～”的感觉，\n好像在哪里听过……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"91be1f95fe63dee497d16874a1f413a9f764e56d538c05ab2230c822f8ef8c48","ja":"はい！\nベートヴェンの第九『歓喜の歌』です！","zh":"是的！\n是贝多芬的第九交响曲《欢乐颂》！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a2892f2a01cedc259aed8518c162f36c4fa34c1f3af2177e1839ea91ed887ede","ja":"ピンポン、ピンポーン！","zh":"叮咚、叮咚——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6a22de07f16d07bfe232143e8165acf7e0bb868e81b0776239a5e717d751ab2b","ja":"……やった。正解できた……！","zh":"……太好了。答对了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"583ae20abb5862310175cd2402369c76acf9f83f2f495a5b5900de89f7da2eba","ja":"千早さん、すごいですーっ！","zh":"千早，好厉害啊——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4b1d8c69713f03e3e9a05d0651b1dad9efdb158f9da9aea383d2584ecd5a7a4a","ja":"あたしたちが優勝だよ～！\n千早さんのおかげだねぇ……あれぇ？","zh":"是我们赢了哦～！\n多亏了千早呢……咦～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"0334ce64fa17481d09928ea336a5c241851432ce655521e906d89f6a43301df9","ja":"ち、千早さん、どうしたんですかー！？","zh":"千、千早，你怎么了啊——！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3c693f7341527cf7bda3ca44eb7c754eba6e790496b9f80202c5fcab073bd0f1","ja":"だ、大丈夫。ちょっと安心して\n気が緩んだだけだから……。","zh":"没、没事的。只是稍微放下心来，\n有些松懈了而已……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1130.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"79c37ebceee3fd616b9da2fe6c9b8e1ca095e4080754029f4077917784d80d7b","ja":"でも……ふたりの力になれて本当によかったわ。\nふふ……。","zh":"不过……能帮上你们两个人的忙，真是太好了。\n呵呵……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
